---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "What to Pack for China — Seasons & Climate Guide";
const description = "What to pack for China based on seasons and cities — from Beijing winters to Guangzhou summers.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="th">
 <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
 <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
 <a href="/th/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
 </svg>
 Back to ชีวิต
 </a>
 </nav>
 <header class="mb-12">
 <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🎒 ชีวิตในจีน</p>
 <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
 What to Pack for China<br class="hidden md:block" />: Seasons & Climate Guide
 </h1>
 <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">Packing for China is different — here is what you actually need.</p>
 <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
 <span>📅 อัปเดตล่าสุด: มิถุนายน 2026</span>
 <span>⏱️ 6 min read</span>
 </div>
 </header>

 <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
 <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 คำตอบด่วน</h2>
 <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
 <strong>China has extreme seasonal variation.</strong> Beijing in winter is freezing (-10°C), while Guangzhou in summer is sweltering (35°C+ with humidity). The key is packing layers and preparing for the specific cities and seasons you'll visit. Across the board: comfortable walking shoes, a power bank, toilet paper, and a reusable water bottle are essentials regardless of season.
 </p>
 </div>

 <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
 <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 ในคู่มือนี้</h3>
 <ul class="space-y-3">
 <li><a href="#year-round" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎒 Year-Round Essentials</a></li>
 <li><a href="#spring" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🌸 Spring (March–May)</a></li>
 <li><a href="#summer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">☀️ Summer (June–August)</a></li>
 <li><a href="#autumn" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍂 Autumn (September–November)</a></li>
 <li><a href="#winter" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">❄️ Winter (December–February)</a></li>
 <li><a href="#city-guide" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏙️ City-by-City Quick Guide</a></li>
 </ul>
 </nav>

 <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
 <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

 <h2 id="year-round" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
 <span class="text-4xl">🎒</span> Year-Round Essentials
 </h2>

 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">These items should be in your bag no matter when or where you visit:</p>

 <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
 <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
 <thead>
 <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
 <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Item</th>
 <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Why</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>Power bank</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">Phone battery dies fast with navigation + translation + payments</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>Universal travel adapter</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">China uses Type A/I sockets (220V)</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>Portable toilet paper / tissues</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">Many public toilets don't provide paper</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>Hand sanitizer</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">Not all places have soap</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>Reusable water bottle</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">Hotels and stations have hot water dispensers</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>Comfortable walking shoes</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">You'll average 15,000+ steps daily</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>A small backpack/daypack</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">Not all attractions allow large bags</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>Passport & visa copies</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">Keep digital copies too</td></tr>
 </tbody>
 </table>
 </div>

 <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
 <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Important:</strong> For domestic flights and high-speed rail security checks, power banks are required to bear a 3C certification mark and have a capacity of no more than 20,000 mAh. If you plan to visit multiple cities in China, it is recommended that you purchase a qualified power bank in the first city you arrive in.</p>
 </div>

 <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

 <h2 id="spring" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
 <span class="text-4xl">🌸</span> Spring (March–May)
 </h2>

 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Temperatures:</strong> 10°C–25°C (Beijing cooler, Guangzhou warmer)</p>
 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>Conditions:</strong> Mild but unpredictable. Rain likely in April–May, especially in the south.</p>

 <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pack:</p>
 <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Light jacket or hoodie (essential — spring evenings can be cold)</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Long pants and long-sleeve shirts</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> An umbrella or light rain jacket</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> A scarf (useful for wind and dust)</li>
 </ul>

 <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

 <h2 id="summer" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
 <span class="text-4xl">☀️</span> Summer (June–August)
 </h2>

 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Temperatures:</strong> 25°C–40°C (Beijing dry heat, Guangzhou/Shanghai humid)</p>
 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>Conditions:</strong> Hot everywhere. Southern cities are especially humid. Monsoon rain common.</p>

 <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pack:</p>
 <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Light, breathable clothing (cotton, linen)</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Sunscreen (SPF 50+)</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Sunglasses and a hat</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> An umbrella (for both sun and rain)</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span> Many attractions (Forbidden City, Great Wall) have minimal shade — plan accordingly</li>
 </ul>

 <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

 <h2 id="autumn" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
 <span class="text-4xl">🍂</span> Autumn (September–November)
 </h2>

 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Temperatures:</strong> 5°C–22°C (cooling down, comfortable)</p>
 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>Conditions:</strong> The most pleasant season. Clear skies, cool air, low humidity.</p>

 <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pack:</p>
 <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Layers: t-shirt + light jacket or sweater</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Jeans or comfortable pants</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> A mid-weight jacket for evenings</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> This is the ideal season for outdoor activities</li>
 </ul>

 <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

 <h2 id="winter" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
 <span class="text-4xl">❄️</span> Winter (December–February)
 </h2>

 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Temperatures:</strong> -15°C (Beijing/Harbin) to 15°C (Guangzhou/Shenzhen)</p>
 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>Conditions:</strong> Freezing in the north, mild in the south. Dry air with low humidity.</p>

 <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pack (for north; the south is like Autumn):</p>
 <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Heavy winter coat / down jacket (essential for Beijing, Xi'an, or anywhere north)</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Thermal underwear (if visiting the north)</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Hat, gloves, scarf — non-negotiable in winter</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> Lip balm and moisturizer (central heating dries out skin)</li>
 <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span> Harbin can reach -30°C — pack extreme cold gear if going that far north</li>
 </ul>

 <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

 <h2 id="city-guide" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
 <span class="text-4xl">🏙️</span> City-by-City Quick Guide
 </h2>

 <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
 <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
 <thead>
 <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
 <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">City</th>
 <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Summer (°C)</th>
 <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Winter (°C)</th>
 <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Key packing advice</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Beijing</td><td class="px-6 py-4">25–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">-10 to 5</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Heavy coat in winter, sun protection in summer</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Shanghai</td><td class="px-6 py-4">25–37</td><td class="px-6 py-4">0–10</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Humid year-round; rain jacket essential</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Guangzhou</td><td class="px-6 py-4">28–38</td><td class="px-6 py-4">10–18</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Warm year-round; light clothes + rain gear</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Shenzhen</td><td class="px-6 py-4">28–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">12–20</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Similar to Guangzhou; beachwear in summer</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Chengdu</td><td class="px-6 py-4">22–32</td><td class="px-6 py-4">2–10</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Overcast often; comfortable layers year-round</td></tr>
 <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Xi'an</td><td class="px-6 py-4">23–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">-5 to 8</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Similar to Beijing but slightly warmer</td></tr>
 </tbody>
 </table>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
 <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 คู่มือที่เกี่ยวข้อง</h3>
 <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
