 <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 Your China Trip Survival Kit</p>
 <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">The complete pre-travel checklist</p>
 </a>
 <a href="/th/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
 <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 10 Apps You Need for China</p>
 <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">แอปพลิเคชันที่จำเป็น for navigation and more</p>
 </a>
 <a href="/th/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
 <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🚄 How to Get Around China</p>
 <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Navigate between cities with ease</p>
 </a>
 </div>
 </div>
 
 <!-- แหล่งอ้างอิง -->
 <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
 <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">แหล่งอ้างอิง</h3>
 <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
 <li>Practical advice — no single official source.</li>
 </ul>
 </div>
 </article>
</Layout>